["14:00"]={
{"“Where exactly? And when? We’ll need to be there.”\n“The square. On the steps of the old library.” She glanced to the clock above the pub. “\003Two hours past midday\004, I believe.”","From These Dark Depths","Vanessa Rasanen",true},
