{"\003About three o’clock\004 the four couples, frightened at their happiness, were sliding down the Russian mountains, a singular edifice which then occupied the heights of Beaujon, and whose undulating line was visible above the trees of the Champs Élysées.","Les Misérables","Victor Hugo",true},
